1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,731
(Howard:)In your supercooled
helium experiments,

2
00:00:01,736 --> 00:00:04,206
(Howard:)did you create
quantum vortices?

3
00:00:04,205 --> 00:00:05,205
(Leonard:)Yeah. Why?

4
00:00:05,206 --> 00:00:06,506
(Howard:)Well, if you made
a guidance system,

5
00:00:06,507 --> 00:00:08,937
(Howard:)couldn't you use those vortices
as a gyroscope?

6
00:00:08,943 --> 00:00:11,413
(Leonard:)Wow. I've never thought
about that.

7
00:00:11,412 --> 00:00:13,012
(Howard:)And since
it's in a quantum state,

8
00:00:13,014 --> 00:00:14,814
(Howard:)it would maintain
an infinite persistence.

9
00:00:14,815 --> 00:00:17,445
(Raj:)Groundbreaking revelations,
tropical drinks.

10
00:00:17,451 --> 00:00:21,491
(Raj:)Tell me this isn't like the best
episode of Sex and the City.

11
00:00:23,524 --> 00:00:26,254
(Leonard:)You may have actually
just come up with something.

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,960
(Howard:)You think so?
I really do.

13
00:00:27,962 --> 00:00:30,962
(Sheldon:)You guys, the bathroom
here is amazing.

14
00:00:30,965 --> 00:00:33,595
(Sheldon:)There's people
cooking in it.

15
00:00:36,337 --> 00:00:37,837
(Amy:)Think about all the fun
things you get to do

16
00:00:37,838 --> 00:00:39,208
(Amy:)when you have a baby.
Yeah!

17
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:42,446
(Penny:)Yeah, you get to buy toys
and little clothes.

18
00:00:42,443 --> 00:00:45,443
(Bernadette:)I kind of already do that
for Howie.

19
00:00:45,446 --> 00:00:47,346
And-and whenever you're hungry,

20
00:00:47,348 --> 00:00:51,448
(Penny:)you'll be in a minivan with
Cheerios all over the floor.

21
00:00:51,452 --> 00:00:54,322
(Amy:)Oh, and I just found a
new travel cup for Sheldon.

22
00:00:54,321 --> 00:00:56,451
(Amy:)It only lets out
three at a time.

23
00:00:57,558 --> 00:01:00,258
(Amy:)So, when did you guys
decide to get pregnant?

